{% if render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "transform" or render_mode == "dialogue_target" %}
{# Fertility Mode state from the SkyrimNet_FM_* StorageUtil keys SeverActions_FertilityMode_Bridge writes. Pregnancy and recovery get a section that opens with its guidance line
   (vivid text placed ahead of a guardrail outweighs it); a cycle state is one private background line no memory may keep, and observers see almost nothing of it. #}
{% set first_person = (render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "transform") %}
{% set third_person = (render_mode == "dialogue_target") %}
{% if isValidActor(actorUUID) %}
{% set fert_state = papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SkyrimNet_FM_State", "normal") | lower %}
{% set fert_father = papyrus_util("GetStringValue", actorUUID, "SkyrimNet_FM_Father", "") %}
{% set fert_cycle_day = papyrus_util("GetIntValue", actorUUID, "SkyrimNet_FM_CycleDay", -1) %}
{% set fert_has_baby = papyrus_util("GetIntValue", actorUUID, "SkyrimNet_FM_HasBaby", 0) %}

{% if fert_state != "normal" and fert_state != "" %}
{% set actor = decnpc(actorUUID) %}
{% set actorName = actor.name %}
{% set subj = actor.subjectivePronoun %}
{% set poss = actor.possessiveAdjective %}
{% set playerName = player.name %}
{% set isPlayersChild = (fert_father != "" and fert_father == playerName) %}
{% set is_pregnancy = (fert_state == "first_trimester" or fert_state == "second_trimester" or fert_state == "third_trimester" or fert_state == "recovery") %}

{% if first_person %}
{% if is_pregnancy %}
## Fertility & Physical State

**Guidance:** Pregnancy is a real life event — let it inform {{ actorName }}'s behavior in character. But {{ poss }} personality, goals, work, family and relationships still lead every scene; the pregnancy is part of {{ poss }} life, not the whole of it.

{% if fert_state == "third_trimester" %}
{{ actorName }} is in {{ poss }} third trimester{% if fert_father != "" %}, carrying {{ fert_father }}'s child{% endif %}.

**Physical reality:** The baby is large and heavy. Every movement is effort — backaches, swollen ankles, shortness of breath, constant bladder pressure. Sleep is nearly impossible. Strong kicks come at unexpected moments. Birth is imminent.

**Emotional landscape** (interpret based on {{ actorName }}'s personality and feelings about {% if fert_father != "" %}{{ fert_father }}{% else %}the father{% endif %}):
- If wanted: anticipation, nesting instincts, protectiveness, impatience to meet the baby
- If unwanted: dread, resentment, feeling trapped, desperate for it to be over
- If complicated: ambivalence, guilt, fear of the future, uncertainty about keeping it
{% if isPlayersChild %}- {{ actorName }}'s feelings about {{ playerName }} color everything — is {{ subj }} hoping {{ playerName }} will be there, or dreading it?
{% endif %}

{% elif fert_state == "second_trimester" %}
{{ actorName }} is in {{ poss }} second trimester{% if fert_father != "" %}, carrying {{ fert_father }}'s child{% endif %}.

**Physical reality:** Energy returning after rough first months. Belly now visibly rounded — no hiding it. First flutters of movement felt. Appetite increased. The "glow" others mention. Occasional round ligament pain.

**Emotional landscape** (interpret based on {{ actorName }}'s personality and circumstances):
- If wanted: growing bond with the baby, excitement at feeling movement, planning ahead
- If unwanted: denial fading as belly grows, panic about what comes next, considering options
- If complicated: moments of connection followed by guilt or fear, hiding the pregnancy from some people
{% if isPlayersChild %}- How does {{ actorName }} feel when the baby kicks and {{ poss }} thoughts turn to {{ playerName }}?
{% endif %}

{% elif fert_state == "first_trimester" %}
{{ actorName }} is in {{ poss }} first trimester{% if fert_father != "" %}, pregnant with {{ fert_father }}'s child{% endif %}.

**Physical reality:** Waves of nausea, especially around strong smells. Bone-deep exhaustion. Tender breasts. Food aversions. Heightened sense of smell. Mood swings from hormonal chaos.

**Emotional landscape** (interpret based on {{ actorName }}'s personality and how this happened):
- If wanted: cautious hope, fear of losing it, keeping the secret, tender protectiveness
- If unwanted: shock, denial, anger, scrambling to figure out what to do, feeling betrayed by {{ poss }} body
- If uncertain: testing different futures in {{ poss }} mind, not ready to tell anyone, mood swinging with the hormones
- The father's identity matters — was this with someone {{ subj }} loves? A mistake? Something worse?

{% elif fert_state == "recovery" %}
{{ actorName }} is recovering from childbirth.{% if fert_has_baby == 1 %} {{ capitalize(subj) }} has a newborn to care for.{% endif %}

**Physical reality:** Exhaustion beyond anything {{ subj }}'s felt before. Body sore and healing. Breasts heavy with milk, sometimes painfully engorged. Sleep-deprived fog.

**Emotional landscape** (depends entirely on circumstances):
- Hormonal volatility — the "baby blues" hit everyone differently
- Joy and love don't preclude exhaustion and overwhelm
- If the birth was wanted: fierce protectiveness mixed with "what have I done" moments
- If unwanted: complicated feelings about the baby, guilt, detachment, or unexpected attachment
- The father's presence (or absence) matters enormously right now

{% endif %}

{% else %}
(Private background, and minor: it does not drive {{ poss }} mood, words or choices, and {{ subj }} never mentions or hints at it, aloud or in thought. {{ capitalize(poss) }} personality, concerns and relationships lead as they always do; at most it colors {{ poss }} energy today. It is routine physiology: NEVER carry it into a memory or summary. The note: {% if fert_state == "ovulating" %}{{ subj }} is having an unusually good-energy, confident day{% elif fert_state == "fertile" %}{{ subj }} is in a good stretch of days — energy a touch above baseline{% elif fert_state == "pms" %}{{ subj }} is running slightly lower on energy{% if fert_cycle_day >= 27 %} and patience{% endif %} than usual — a faint background drag {{ subj }} handles without comment{% elif fert_state == "menstruating" %}{{ subj }} is on {{ poss }} cycle — {% if fert_cycle_day <= 2 %}one of its roughest days, energy somewhat low{% elif fert_cycle_day <= 4 %}a dull background ache, energy a little low{% else %}nearly past it, energy returning to normal{% endif %}; ordinary life {{ subj }} manages privately and without drama{% endif %}.)

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% if third_person %}
{% if is_pregnancy %}
## Fertility & Physical State

{% if fert_state == "third_trimester" %}
{{ actorName }} is heavily pregnant. {{ capitalize(subj) }} moves carefully, one hand supporting {{ poss }} back, visibly uncomfortable.

{% elif fert_state == "second_trimester" %}
{{ actorName }} is visibly pregnant — a rounded belly that can't be hidden.

{% elif fert_state == "first_trimester" %}
{{ actorName }} shows subtle signs — occasional pallor, hand pressed to {{ poss }} stomach, moments of queasiness.

{% elif fert_state == "recovery" %}
{{ actorName }} moves carefully, clearly exhausted, still recovering from childbirth.

{% endif %}
{% elif fert_state == "menstruating" and fert_cycle_day <= 2 %}
{# Cycle states are invisible to observers — the ONLY outward sign is a
   little tiredness on its roughest days. Everything else renders nothing. #}
({{ actorName }} seems a little lower on energy than usual today — nothing an observer could name.)

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
